      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body text",
      "default": "<p>LEGENDARY BRANDING was born from a belief that streetwear shouldn't be disposable. Every piece is designed to be lived in, broken in, and worn until it tells its own story.</p><p>We don't chase seasons. We chase construction. 235GSM tees. 400GSM hoodies. DTG prints that survive hundreds of washes. No fast fashion. No drops designed to fail.</p><p>Limited runs mean less waste and more intention. Once a piece sells out, it's gone. That's how we keep it special — for the people who found it, not the algorithm.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "READ OUR STORY"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_url",
      "label": "Button URL"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Images"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Main image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "image_main_label",
      "label": "Main image label",
      "default": "Rose Bowl Crewneck"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_side",
      "label": "Side image"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Stats"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_1_num",
      "label": "Stat 1 number",
      "default": "84+"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_1_label",
      "label": "Stat 1 label",
      "default": "Products"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_2_num",
      "label": "Stat 2 number",
      "default": "7"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_2_label",
      "label": "Stat 2 label",
      "default": "Drops"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_3_num",
      "label": "Stat 3 number",
      "default": "3.2k"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_3_label",
      "label": "Stat 3 label",
      "default": "Customers"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_4_num",
      "label": "Stat 4 number",
      "default": "4.9★"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stat_4_label",
      "label": "Stat 4 label",
      "default": "Avg Review"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Color scheme"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "options": [
        { "value": "scheme-1", "label": "Light (White)" },
        { "value": "scheme-2", "label": "Light Alt" },
        { "value": "scheme-4", "label": "Dark Grey" },
        { "value": "scheme-5", "label": "True Black" }
      ],
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Brand Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}